,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'HTML for one node, used by the Custom Template view. The view is offered (Default View, Views Users Can Pick) only when a template is entered here.',
'',
'A sample to start from - photo, title, subtitle, status and badge in a row, then the body fields, the team / roll-up totals and the footer:',
'<div class="hcp-tpl">&AVATAR.<div class="hcp-tpl-tx"><div class="hcp-t">&TITLE.</div><div class="hcp-st">&SUBTITLE.</div>&STATUS.</div>&BADGE.</div>&FIELDS.&TOTALS.&FOOTER.',
'',
'Substitutions: &TITLE. &SUBTITLE. &AVATAR. (photo, icon or initials) &ICON. &BADGE. &BADGES. (one chip per badge) &STATUS. &FIELDS. (Body Columns 1-4) &TOTALS. (team and roll-up) &FOOTER. (the footer section) &COLOR. &CHILD_COUNT. &DESC_COUNT. &ROLLU'
||'P. &LEVEL. &ID. and &ANY_COLUMN. of the query. Values are escaped unless the column''s Escape special characters is off; the Card Content switches apply. Ready-made classes: hcp-t (title), hcp-st (muted line), hcp-tpl / hcp-tpl-tx (photo and text side'
||' by side).'))
);
