,p_attribute_group_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(11536647686383372)
,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'Shadow / Rounded Corners / Compact Density / Photos: card look (Compact and Photos also have toolbar switches).',
'Context Menu: right-click (or Shift+F10) menu with Open, Focus, Expand / Collapse branch, Highlight path, Show only this branch.',
'Remember State: keeps expanded nodes, orientation and view for the browser session.',
'Lazy Loading: only loads children when a node is expanded - for trees with thousands of nodes. Needs Hierarchy = Parent ID Column; children are counted for you, so closed nodes still show their team size.',
'Mini-map: overview navigator in the corner.',
'Legend: statuses (with counts) and Legend Column groups; clicking one picks those nodes out.',
'Level Bands: alternating bands per level, named by the Level Name Column (Level 1, Level 2 ... without one).',
'Highlight Whole Branch: path highlighting also lights up the node''s subtree.',
'Ctrl + Wheel to Zoom: the page keeps scrolling with the mouse wheel; zoom with Ctrl + wheel or pinch.',
'Animate: smooth expand / collapse / layout changes (always off for users who prefer reduced motion).'))
);
